nImmerse yourself in a virtual game and discover a world of limitless possibilities brimming with fun and excitement. \nEnjoy the thrills and enchantment of a theme park from the comfort of your own home. \nFrom the joys of a rollercoaster ride to levitating water slides, Znanyeland is the safest way to relish the excitement of a theme park. \nThere is something for everyone! Get nostalgic and savour the thrill of it all. hop on and take a ride!", "short_description": "In these ever-changing times, we believe that everyone should be able to enjoy a theme park experience without having to leave their homes. \nZnanyeland is a specially designed virtual theme park, tailored to accomplish just that. Our goal is to design this carnival with a safe environment to enjoy a theme park experience at the comfort of their own homes.\n It's also entirely free!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.znanye.com/#", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Pastelcube Technologies Private Limited", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.znanye.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "726368587961803"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["ADVENTURE", "CASUAL", "EXPLORATION"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["GAMEPAD", "OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["ROOM_SCALE", "STANDING", "SITTING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "485808706246593"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "315060623836191"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "315060623836191"}, "is_ap